    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mecha Legends </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the pilot of massive mechanical armor, embark on a hunt for dragons and other fantasy creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harsh Battles and Challenges:</strong> Face powerful dragons and dangerous creatures dwelling in the darkest corners of the world. Only true skill will allow you to overcome these dangers and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Mecha:</strong> Modify the appearance, weaponry, and abilities of your mecha to create a unique knight. Master the art of tactical combat using heavy weapons, enchanted armor, and destructive magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Vast Locations:</strong> From dense forests to ancient ruins, discover numerous unique creatures and environments.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mecha Legends </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the pilot of massive mechanical armor, embark on a hunt for dragons and other fantasy creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harsh Battles and Challenges:</strong> Face powerful dragons and dangerous creatures dwelling in the darkest corners of the world. Only true skill will allow you to overcome these dangers and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Mecha:</strong> Modify the appearance, weaponry, and abilities of your mecha to create a unique knight. Master the art of tactical combat using heavy weapons, enchanted armor, and destructive magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Vast Locations:</strong> From dense forests to ancient ruins, discover numerous unique creatures and environments.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Mecha Legends As the pilot of a massive mechanical armor, you will face powerful dragons and dangerous creatures dwelling in the darkest corners of the world. Customize your mecha: Change its appearance, weapons, and abilities!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
